# write-atomic then slurp roundtrip: atomic write to target/, read it back
# % is used as an intermediate expression to force the write side-effect.
[write-atomic [narrow pwd "target"] "tinct-test-write-atomic-slurp.txt" "atomic write works"]
---
%
[slurp [open [narrow pwd "target"] "tinct-test-write-atomic-slurp.txt" "r"]]
=== out
String("atomic write works")
=== warn
undefined variable: pwd
